  "problem": "A hotel has $71$ rooms. The manager has observed that when the room rate is $$50$ per night, all rooms are occupied and, for every $$2$ increase in the rate, a single room is vacated. If the maintenance per rented room is $$4$ per night, what rate per room should the manager set to obtain the maximum profit?",
